OL,3,ARussell Brand asked assistant for
OL,4,Afemale fan phone numbers, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe allegations, made by six female
OL,7,Fcomplainants, span a 10-year period
OL,8,Fbetween 1999 and 2009. He denies the
OL,9,Fcharges.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/18
